# Video/image assets are deliberately not tracked - game.mp4 alone is 620MB,
# too big for a normal git history. find_default_video() in main.py looks for
# game.mp4, test.mp4 or input.mp4 in this folder and prints exactly that path
# if none is found - supply the clip separately (a Drive link + this exact
# filename dropped in here is the usual way) rather than adding it to git.
*.mp4
*.jpg
*.png
